.TH GPSTIME 1 "JULY 1997" Linux "User Manuals"
.SH NAME
gpstime \- calculate GPS day and week
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gpstime 
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gpstime
calculates conversions between GPS day and week, day-of-year, modified
julian date, and common day, month, year format. The program is
interactive and should be self-explanatory.
.SH BUGS
The program should be less picky about the way one enters time
and checking errors in a better way.
.SH AUTHOR
Marc Cocard <cocard@geod.ethz.ch>

